# Keep the Docker build context small: the images only COPY backend/,
# frontend/, docker/ and requirements.txt. Without this, every build uploaded
# the ~1 GB database dumps and the NAS bundle tars as context.
*.dump
mednama-nas-deploy/
pdfs/
pdfs.zip
toDo/
logs/
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
.git
diagnosis_*.txt
